Package: scpro
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt5.qtwebengine, python3-yaml, rsync, openssh-client
Recommends: sshpass
Description: VS Code-styled deployment console for robot software
 SCPro packs a local workspace with exclude rules, verifies the target over
 SSH and uploads it with rsync. Hosts are read from ~/.ssh/config, projects
 are described in a single YAML file, and every run is streamed into a live
 log panel.
 .
 The GUI follows the local VS Code color theme and ships with a self-contained
 deployment engine that can also be used from the command line.
